{"team":"DET","col":"#4FA8E8","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":63.3,"adot":6.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Balanced Attack</h2><p>They're a heavy under-center team (48% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Amon-Ra St. Brown</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>Their backs are a real part of the passing game \u2014 RBs see <strong>22%</strong> of targets (vs ~18%), which props up <strong>Jahmyr Gibbs</strong>'s reception floor.</p><p>It's a short, rhythm-based passing game \u2014 aDOT just <strong>6.5</strong> \u2014 that lives on YAC and checkdowns, boosting reception totals over big-play yardage.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's an efficient unit \u2014 a 48% success rate (above the 44% average).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (50% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Jahmyr Gibbs</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p><strong>Soft against opposing WR2s</strong> \u2014 45 rec yds/game (vs ~36). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They give up deep shots (24% of throws travel 15+ vs ~19%) \u2014 big-play WR upside against them.</p><p>They surrender <strong>109 rushing</strong> and <strong>249 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.63/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>TE touchdowns</strong> (0.29/game vs ~0.24) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing TE anytime-TD</strong> is a repeatable angle.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Jared Goff","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":4,"props":{"Comp":23.23,"Att":34.11,"Pass Yds":259.85,"Pass TD":1.81,"INT":0.5,"Rush Yds":4.74},"d":{"completions":23.23,"attempts":34.11,"pass_yards":259.85,"pass_td":1.81,"interceptions":0.5,"rush_att":1.87,"rush_yards":4.74}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jahmyr Gibbs","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":59,"props":{"Rush Att":22.69,"Rush Yds":119.41,"Tgt":6.24,"Rec":4.95,"Rec Yds":39.22},"d":{"rush_att":22.69,"rush_yards":119.41,"targets":6.24,"receptions":4.95,"rec_yards":39.22,"rec_td":0.17}},{"name":"Sione Vaki","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":9,"props":{"Rush Att":3.17,"Rush Yds":12.37,"Tgt":1.44,"Rec":1.0,"Rec Yds":8.01},"d":{"rush_att":3.17,"rush_yards":12.37,"targets":1.44,"receptions":1.0,"rec_yards":8.01,"rec_td":0.03}},{"name":"Jacob Saylors","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Rush Att":3.7,"Rush Yds":15.76,"Tgt":1.36,"Rec":0.93,"Rec Yds":6.94},"d":{"rush_att":3.7,"rush_yards":15.76,"targets":1.36,"receptions":0.93,"rec_yards":6.94,"rec_td":0.03}}],"WR":[{"name":"Amon-Ra St. Brown","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":41,"props":{"Tgt":11.22,"Rec":8.3,"Rec Yds":94.6,"Rec TD":0.53},"d":{"targets":11.22,"receptions":8.3,"rec_yards":94.6,"rec_td":0.53}},{"name":"Jameson Williams","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":32,"props":{"Tgt":7.64,"Rec":4.68,"Rec Yds":74.77,"Rec TD":0.4},"d":{"targets":7.64,"receptions":4.68,"rec_yards":74.77,"rec_td":0.4}},{"name":"Isaac TeSlaa","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Tgt":3.71,"Rec":2.27,"Rec Yds":30.0,"Rec TD":0.26},"d":{"targets":3.71,"receptions":2.27,"rec_yards":30.0,"rec_td":0.26}},{"name":"Tom Kennedy","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":3.51,"Rec":1.87,"Rec Yds":22.97,"Rec TD":0.09},"d":{"